  m_text: '    1. Adjust the answer controls described in the question.

    2.
    Click the check button and read the feedback.

    3. Apply an accepted repair,
    or return to Case overview after a stable module.


    Drag and drop also supports
    clicking a source, then its target.

    Operation help is free and pauses active
    time and environmental pressure.'
